SUMMARY:Panoply Theatre TALENT SHOW
DESCRIPTION:🎪Live out your talent show dreams with Panoply Theatre Collective on Friday April 24th! \n🪩 For our 2026-2027 season launch\, Panoply invites you to join us for an evening of performances and party time! Enjoy a cabaret of talented performers and be the first in the know about Panoply’s upcoming shows.  \n🥂Doors open at 7:30pm and performances run from 8-9pm\, with time to mix/mingle through the night. The Society Clubhouse is fully accessible\, has a bar with alcoholic and non-alcoholic drinks & snacks\, and comedians from our Clowns Reading Shakespeare show will be running a raffle with awesome prizes!
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/panoply-theatre-talent-show/
LOCATION:Society Clubhouse\, 967 College Street\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6H 1A6
CATEGORIES:Comedy & Improv,Community Events,Live Music,Performing Arts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/panoply-theatre-talent-show.png
END:VEVENT
