SUMMARY:Brilliant Traces by Cindy Lou Johnson
DESCRIPTION:An Intimate Evening of Live Theatre at Theatre Passe Muraille Backspace \nCome see the inaugural production of SlipTrap Theatre\, Toronto’s newest independent theatre. \nExperience Brilliant Traces by Cindy Lou Johnson up close in a space where every breath\, glance\, and silence lands. At Theatre Passe Muraille backspace\, there’s no distance between audience and story — just raw\, immediate human connection. \nBrilliant Traces \nby Cindy Lou Johnson \nPresented by SlipTrap Theatre \nIn the remote wilds of Alaska\, a woman stumbles out of the snow with no destination and a need to keep moving. \nA storm rises. Roads vanish. Car batteries die. The isolated cabin of an oil rig worker becomes the only refuge left. \nAt the edge of nowhere two strangers collide\, each carrying a past they refuse to name. As the storm tightens its grip\, stories fracture\, truths slip\, and what begins as mercy transforms into something else entirely. \nDesolate and haunting\, Brilliant Traces is about isolation\, loss\, change and the rarest of intimacy. When a life is in free fall\, what is there to grab on to\, and at what cost? \n MORE INFO AT www.sliptraptheatre.com
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/brilliant-traces-by-cindy-lou-johnson/
LOCATION:Theatre Passe Muraille\, 16 Ryerson Ave\, Toronto\, M5T 2P3
CATEGORIES:Performing Arts,Theatre & Opera
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/brilliant-traces-by-cindy-lou-johnson.png
END:VEVENT
