SUMMARY:Black Sheep Comedy @ Rorschach Brewing Co. Featuring TED MORRIS
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a hilarious night of stand up comedy featuring TED MORRIS & Friends. Plus\, get a comp 13oz beer or pop with your ticket. \nBlack Sheep is back at Rorschach Brewing Co. with a hilarious lineup of stand up comedians\, including the incredible TED MORRIS (Just For Laughs\, America’s Got Talent\, The Comedy Network & more). \nTed Morris is joined by Jwalit Bharwani\, Ada Nicolle\, Kristin Doucet & Nathan Griffith! \nPLUS\, get a complimentary 13oz beer or pop with your ticket. \nTickets are just $20 in advance\, $25 at the door (if available). \nNote: This is an intimate venue. Advanced ticket purchase is recommended. \nABOUT TED MORRIS \nBorn in Ottawa and now making his home in Toronto\, Ted Morris discovered his love of stand up comedy while looking for a way to blow off steam while he was studying to become a veterinarian.He has performed at the “We’re Funny That Way” \, Halifax\, Winnipeg\, Glasgow and Sudbury Comedy Festivals\, is a rostered comic for the Yuk Yuk’s chain of comedy clubs and a sought after corporate comedian. In 2016 he made his debut at the prestigious Just For Laughs Festival in Montreal where he filmed a set for Kevin Hart’s LOL Network. \nHis TV appearances include an hour long “Comedy Now!” stand-up special airing on The Comedy Network and MTV Canada\, The Toronto Show\, The Comedy Network’s “Canadian Comedy Shorts” and “Punched Up”\, MuchMoreMusic’s “Heat Meter”\, CBC’s Just for Laughs\, Winnipeg and Halifax Comedy Festivals\, Kevin Hart’s LOL Network and Out TV’s “PopPorn”. His latest appearance at the Halifax fest now has over 2 million online views. \nTed can be heard around the world on Sirius XM Radio and in Canada is undefeated on CBC Radio’s “The Debaters”. \nHe was featured in the short film “Parent Teacher” which was an Official Selection of the LA Comedy Film Festival. \nHis recent accomplishments include the release of his long-awaited debut comedy album “Dawn of the Ted” \, being insulted by Simon Cowell on season 14 of “America’s Got Talent”\, his 5th appearance at the Halifax Comedy Festival\, 3rd appearance at the Winnipeg Comedy Festival\, a Gala taping at JFL Montreal\, Comedy Night in Canada with Rick Mercer and a Canadian Comedy Award nomination for Best Stand-up Comic.
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/black-sheep-comedy-rorschach-brewing-co-featuring-ted-morris/
LOCATION:Rorschach Brewing Co.\, 1001 Eastern Ave\, Toronto\, ON M4L 3Z5\, Canada\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M4L 3Z5
CATEGORIES:Comedy & Improv,Performing Arts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/black-sheep-comedy-rorschach-brewing-co-featuring-ted-morris.png
END:VEVENT
