SUMMARY:Latin Friday: Oscar D'Leon Tribute\, Son D'Aqui + Afrolatino Dance
DESCRIPTION:Fridays\, we go to the tropics\, where the vibrant rhythms ignite our souls\, and live music\, dance lessons\, & DJs make it a perfect night! \nThis week\, we have Son D’Aqui\, an all-star Toronto Latin ensemble dedicated to honouring and celebrating the classic repertoire of salsa through tributes to legendary figures in the genre’s history. This week\, they are performing a tribute to the legendary Oscar D’Leon!
