SUMMARY:BAMMY FRIDAYS - THE LIVE BAND X DJ EXPERIENCE
DESCRIPTION:BAMMY FRIDAYS: 2 YEAR ANNIVERSARY \nWhere live music meets DJ culture in one room. \nFor two years\, BAMMY Fridays has become one of Toronto’s go to late night experiences. A live band and DJs move through Lovers Rock\, Dancehall and R&B\, blending nostalgic sounds with a modern energy. \nMore than a party\, BAMMY is a cultural experience. Expect a vibrant crowd\, Caribbean inspired food and a room that feels warm\, alive and connected. It is the kind of night people return to again and again. \nThis anniversary edition celebrates the people\, the music and everything that has been building. \nMusic by resident DJ Rennie and special guest DJ SmartiezLive sets by the Rosh Riddims Band and a lot of special guests throughout the night! Caribbean bites by 9Mile \nDoors 10:30 PMLive band from midnightDJs all night \n19+
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/bammy-fridays-the-live-band-x-dj-experience-2/
LOCATION:Adelaide Hall\, 250 Adelaide St W\, Toronto\, M5H 1X6
CATEGORIES:Cultural Celebrations,Live Music,Nightlife
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/bammy-fridays-the-live-band-x-dj-experience.png
END:VEVENT
